(RESERVE BANK OF INDIA) Tj T*
(Department of Payment and Settlement Systems) Tj T*
(RBI/2026/001) Tj T*
(Circular on Payment Aggregators) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1 Scope) Tj T*
(This circular applies to payment aggregators operating in India.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Definitions) Tj T*
(Payment aggregator means an entity that facilitates aggregation of payments from customers to merchants.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
