3 0 obj
<< /Length 426 >>
stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 760 Td
14 TL
(3 Grievance Redressal) Tj T*
(3.1 Every payment aggregator shall appoint a grievance officer.) Tj T*
(3.2 Every payment aggregator shall maintain a documented grievance redressal process.) Tj T*
(3.3 The grievance redressal process shall include a 48-hour escalation path for unresolved complaints.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Compliance with clause 3.2 and 3.3 is required by 2026-12-01.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
4 0 obj
<< /Length 438 >>
stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
50 760 Td
14 TL
(4 Know Your Customer) Tj T*
(4.1 Every payment aggregator shall maintain a documented KYC policy consistent with applicable directions.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Complaint data) Tj T*
(5.1 Every payment aggregator shall publish quarterly complaint data on its website.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6 Settlement) Tj T*
(6.1 Merchant settlements shall be completed within the timelines stated in the agreement.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
